            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You whirl a foe to smash into all nearby creatures before throwing them far away in imitation of the techniques of your rival, Ran-To. You Thrash. During this Thrash, your Collateral Thrash feat applies to all foes adjacent to you.\n\nYou can then throw the grabbed creature 10 feet, where they fall prone.\n\nIf the foe you choose for Collateral Thrash is also adjacent to you, they attempt only one save and take the damage only once."
